<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title><%= pageTitle %></title>
<meta name="description" content="<%= metaDescription %>">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/about.css">
<link rel="icon" href="/images/favicon.ico">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">About Business ICT Australia</span>
    <h1>Strong &amp; secure. Quietly confident.</h1>
    <p>We're a local team helping Australian small and medium businesses stay connected, protected, and productive — without the jargon.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="section-head__copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our Journey</span>
        <h1>Two decades of change — one steady partner</h1>
        <p>Australian telecommunications has moved fast since 2005 — from copper and 3G to fibre, 5G and cloud. Here's how that industry shifted, alongside how Business ICT grew to meet it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>


    <div class="timeline-key">
      <span class="timeline-key__item"><span class="timeline-key__swatch timeline-key__swatch--industry"></span>Industry &amp; technology</span>
      <span class="timeline-key__item"><span class="timeline-key__swatch timeline-key__swatch--business"></span>Business ICT growth</span>
    </div>

    <div class="timeline">

      <!-- 2005 -->
      <div class="timeline__row timeline__row--dual">
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--left">
          <div class="timeline-card timeline-card--industry">
            <span class="timeline-card__eyebrow">Industry</span>
            <h3>Broadband and mobile take hold</h3>
            <p>ADSL broadband matures and mobile networks expand across Australia, laying the groundwork for always-on business connectivity.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__node">
          <span class="timeline__dot"></span>
          <span class="timeline__year">2005</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--right">
          <div class="timeline-card timeline-card--business">
            <span class="timeline-card__eyebrow">Business ICT</span>
            <h3>The telco dealership begins</h3>
            <p>Our roots start here, in a telco dealership — the foundation everything else was built on.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2009 -->
      <div class="timeline__row timeline__row--industry">
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--left">
          <div class="timeline-card timeline-card--industry">
            <span class="timeline-card__eyebrow">Industry</span>
            <h3>NBN Co is established</h3>
            <p>The National Broadband Network company is formed, kicking off Australia's largest infrastructure project and the shift toward fibre.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__node">
          <span class="timeline__dot"></span>
          <span class="timeline__year">2009</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--right"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2011 -->
      <div class="timeline__row timeline__row--industry">
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--left">
          <div class="timeline-card timeline-card--industry">
            <span class="timeline-card__eyebrow">Industry</span>
            <h3>4G lands in Australia</h3>
            <p>Telstra switches on the country's first commercial 4G/LTE mobile network, opening the door to real mobile broadband speeds for business.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__node">
          <span class="timeline__dot"></span>
          <span class="timeline__year">2011</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--right"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2013 -->
      <div class="timeline__row timeline__row--dual">
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--left">
          <div class="timeline-card timeline-card--industry">
            <span class="timeline-card__eyebrow">Industry</span>
            <h3>NBN shifts to a Multi-Technology Mix</h3>
            <p>The federal government moves the NBN rollout to a mix of fibre, fixed wireless and existing copper/HFC — changing how the network reaches businesses.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__node">
          <span class="timeline__dot"></span>
          <span class="timeline__year">2013</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--right">
          <div class="timeline-card timeline-card--business timeline-card--placeholder">
            <span class="timeline-card__eyebrow">Add a milestone</span>
            <h3>Placeholder</h3>
            <p>e.g. a new product line, a key hire, a first major client — replace with your own event for this year.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2015 -->
      <div class="timeline__row timeline__row--business">
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--left"></div>
        <div class="timeline__node">
          <span class="timeline__dot"></span>
          <span class="timeline__year">2015</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--right">
          <div class="timeline-card timeline-card--business">
            <span class="timeline-card__eyebrow">Business ICT</span>
            <h3>Business ICT is born</h3>
            <p>The dealership evolves into Business ICT Australia — a dedicated ICT solutions provider for Melbourne SMBs.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2017 -->
      <div class="timeline__row timeline__row--dual">
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--left">
          <div class="timeline-card timeline-card--industry">
            <span class="timeline-card__eyebrow">Industry</span>
            <h3>Cloud becomes the default</h3>
            <p>Cloud collaboration and cloud-managed networking hardware become mainstream tools for small and medium business.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__node">
          <span class="timeline__dot"></span>
          <span class="timeline__year">2017</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--right">
          <div class="timeline-card timeline-card--business timeline-card--placeholder">
            <span class="timeline-card__eyebrow">Add a milestone</span>
            <h3>Placeholder</h3>
            <p>e.g. a new office, a new vendor partnership, a team milestone — replace with your own event for this year.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2019 -->
      <div class="timeline__row timeline__row--industry">
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--left">
          <div class="timeline-card timeline-card--industry">
            <span class="timeline-card__eyebrow">Industry</span>
            <h3>5G goes live</h3>
            <p>Telstra launches Australia's first 5G mobile network, beginning the rollout across major cities.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__node">
          <span class="timeline__dot"></span>
          <span class="timeline__year">2019</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--right"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2020 -->
      <div class="timeline__row timeline__row--industry">
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--left">
          <div class="timeline-card timeline-card--industry">
            <span class="timeline-card__eyebrow">Industry</span>
            <h3>Remote work goes mainstream</h3>
            <p>COVID-19 accelerates remote work, VoIP and cloud adoption across Australian small business almost overnight.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__node">
          <span class="timeline__dot"></span>
          <span class="timeline__year">2020</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--right"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2021 -->
      <div class="timeline__row timeline__row--business">
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--left"></div>
        <div class="timeline__node">
          <span class="timeline__dot"></span>
          <span class="timeline__year">2021</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--right">
          <div class="timeline-card timeline-card--business">
            <span class="timeline-card__eyebrow">Business ICT</span>
            <h3>A new home in Mount Waverley</h3>
            <p>Business ICT moves into its Mount Waverley office.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2022 -->
      <div class="timeline__row timeline__row--industry">
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--left">
          <div class="timeline-card timeline-card--industry">
            <span class="timeline-card__eyebrow">Industry</span>
            <h3>The copper network is switched off</h3>
            <p>The final phase of Australia's copper phone network disconnection wraps up, with the NBN now the default fixed-line connection nationally.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__node">
          <span class="timeline__dot"></span>
          <span class="timeline__year">2022</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--right"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Today -->
      <div class="timeline__row timeline__row--dual">
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--left">
          <div class="timeline-card timeline-card--industry">
            <span class="timeline-card__eyebrow">Industry</span>
            <h3>Security and automation, by default</h3>
            <p>Fibre and cloud-managed networking are the standard, and cybersecurity is a baseline expectation for every business, not an add-on.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__node">
          <span class="timeline__dot"></span>
          <span class="timeline__year">Today</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__side timeline__side--right">
          <div class="timeline-card timeline-card--business">
            <span class="timeline-card__eyebrow">Business ICT</span>
            <h3>A full-stack Melbourne MSP</h3>
            <p>Telstra Wholesale mobiles, Cisco Meraki networking, Kyocera print, Yealink voice, and NBN &amp; fibre connectivity — one accountable local partner.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<%- include('partials/footer') %>

<script src="/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>

